    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<div>\n<div>1.<strong>建築與音樂</strong><strong>, </strong><strong>五十嵐太郎</strong><strong>, </strong><strong>菅野裕子</strong><strong>合著，</strong><strong>華中科技大學出版社，</strong><strong>2011</strong></div>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/products/CN11723832?sloc=main\">https://www.books.com.tw/products/CN11723832?sloc=main</a></div>\n\n<div><strong>2. </strong><strong>音樂與建築</strong><strong>︰</strong><strong>兩種語言的相互轉換和音樂解釋學</strong><strong>,</strong><strong>趙鑫珊 </strong><strong>著</strong><strong>, </strong><strong>文匯</strong><strong>出版社</strong><strong>, 2010</strong></div>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/products/CN10732722\">https://www.books.com.tw/products/CN10732722</a></div>\n\n<div><strong>3. </strong><strong>體驗建築</strong><strong>，</strong><strong>拉斯穆生 </strong><strong>Steen </strong><strong>Eiler</strong> <strong>Rasmussen</strong> <strong>著</strong><strong>,</strong><strong>臺隆書店，</strong><strong>1970</strong></div>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://www.talubook.com/index.php?route=product/product&amp;product_id=8433\">https://www.talubook.com/index.php?route=product/product&amp;product_id=8433</a></div>\n\n<div><strong>4. </strong><strong>音樂事情 </strong><strong>Something about Music</strong><strong>，</strong><strong>網路與書編輯部</strong><strong>，</strong><strong>網路與書</strong><strong>出版， </strong><strong>2004</strong></div>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/products/0010279204\">https://www.books.com.tw/products/0010279204</a></div>\n\n<div>5. <strong>Martin, E., Ed. (1994). </strong><u><strong>Architecture as a translation of music</strong></u>. Pamphlet architecture. New York, Princeton Architectural Press.</div>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Architecture-Translation-Music-Pamphlet-16/dp/1568980124\">https://www.amazon.com/Architecture-Translation-Music-Pamphlet-16/dp/1568980124</a></div>\n</div>\n",
